00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.360 line:20%
Sir. Parents are gathering out there.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.080 line:100%
It's been 22 days!

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.240 line:100%
My son, Hong Jinyang,

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:56.400 line:100%
is still nowhere to be seen!

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.200 line:100%
I only have one child.

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:03.160 line:100%
What am I going to do
if something happens to him?

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.120 line:100%
My son…

00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:06.040 line:100%
It has been…

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.040 line:100%
Officer!

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:09.880 line:100%
-Officer.
-Where is my child?

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.640 line:100%
Please. Officer!

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:12.440 line:100%
Don't do that.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:13.440 line:100%
Please.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.840 line:100%
-Find my child.
-Everyone.

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.840 line:100%
Everyone. Please calm down.

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.480 line:100%
We are as anxious as you.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:20.880 line:100%
We haven't slept for a few days.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:24.760 line:100%
Creating a ruckus here
is not going to solve the problem, is it?

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.400 line:100%
-Go. Tear it down.
-Okay.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.280 line:100%
-No! Don't!
-Who dares to tear it down!

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.320 line:100%
No!

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.880 line:100%
Who said you could tear it down?

00:02:38.280 --> 00:02:39.560 line:100%
Keep the posters up.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.920 line:100%
Will tearing the posters down
solve the problem?

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:45.760 line:100%
Will it locate the children?

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:49.200 line:100%
Citizens can post whatever they want.

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.720 line:100%
Use your expertise

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.120 line:100%
if you want to bring the posters down.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:02.840 line:100%
My fellow parents.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.080 line:100%
I am Zhao Jie,

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.120 line:100%
Captain of the Criminal Department
in Nanshan Branch.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.240 line:100%
Today, I will give you my word

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:13.240 line:100%
that within seven days,

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:16.280 line:100%
we will solve the case
and give you an answer.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:19.160 line:100%
If we fail to do so,

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.080 line:100%
I will step down.

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:24.400 line:100%
I'll take your word for it.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.360 line:100%
Thank you so much!

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.960 line:100%
-No need to do this.
-Please.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.320 line:100%
Thank you.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:35.960 line:100%
MISSING PERSON

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.480 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.240 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:48.320 line:20%
MISSING PERSONS SPECIAL TASK FORCE

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.080 line:20%
We have questioned everyone
from the illegal internet cafe

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.280 line:20%
in Yuanlongli.

00:03:51.360 --> 00:03:53.800 line:100%
None of the 18 are under suspicion.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:58.880 line:100%
All five teenagers went missing
after they skipped classes.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:00.560 line:100%
Three of them

00:04:00.640 --> 00:04:03.600 line:20%
last appeared
at the illegal internet cafe.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.320 line:100%
The victims don't know each other.

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.440 line:100%
They couldn't possibly have

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:07.640 line:100%
planned together to go
missing voluntarily.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.080 line:100%
One of them was injured

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:10.880 line:20%
and is currently traumatized.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:14.080 line:100%
We can basically conclude
that it's a serial kidnapping case.

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.680 line:100%
Captain Zhao made a promise yesterday.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.800 line:100%
We only have seven days.

00:04:18.879 --> 00:04:20.240 line:100%
We must find

00:04:20.319 --> 00:04:21.440 line:100%
these kids within seven days,
even if we have

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:22.400 line:100%
to turn the entire city upside down.

00:04:23.520 --> 00:04:25.160 line:100%
Good. Speak.

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.800 line:100%
Captain Qu. If this is the doing
of a serial kidnapper,

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.960 line:100%
can we release a statement to the school

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.880 line:100%
clarifying that Han Zi'ang
is the victim of the kidnapping,

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.280 line:100%
and he only attacked someone
out of fear and shock?

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:38.680 line:100%
You there.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:41.520 line:100%
Handle this matter.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.440 line:100%
Yes, sir!

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.480 line:100%
Let's circle back.

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:50.480 line:100%
Captain Zhao wants us
to submit a new investigation plan.

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:55.120 line:100%
Let's work together and brainstorm.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.720 line:100%
You can still take more pawns.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:05.360 line:100%
-Dad.
-That's right.

00:05:05.440 --> 00:05:06.560 line:100%
Hey.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:10.840 line:100%
So?

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.400 line:100%
Got your assignment?

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.280 line:100%
Nothing.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:16.520 line:100%
Other than a few side-eyes.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.800 line:100%
Qu Dahai doesn't have
what it takes to solve cases.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.400 line:100%
He learned a few tricks from Ran
and began to show off.

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.320 line:100%
Sooner or later,
he'll lead the case to a dead end.

00:05:27.400 --> 00:05:29.080 line:100%
We're having an emergency.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.360 line:100%
Stop saying something unhelpful.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:34.000 line:100%
But Ran's theory is still useful.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.200 line:100%
Everything has a center.

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.440 line:100%
And outside the center,
there will be ripples.

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:41.880 line:100%
Dad. I've read the book thrice.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:43.400 line:100%
What are you getting at?

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:51.840 line:100%
CHAPTER 2: "EYE OF THE VORTEX THEORY"

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.080 line:100%
To see the eye of the vortex,

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.960 line:100%
you must be part of it.

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.440 line:100%
The Eye of the Vortex Theory.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.280 line:100%
Officer He,

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.720 line:100%
I don't know anything
about investigations.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:14.760 line:100%
But allow me to thank you
on behalf of the school.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:16.480 line:100%
If you hadn't defended

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.320 line:100%
Han Zi'ang this relentlessly,

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:20.880 line:100%
this turn of events
wouldn't have occurred at all.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.440 line:100%
Right now, the students
and the parents no longer view Han Zi'ang

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.800 line:100%
as a problematic student,

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:29.360 line:100%
but as a hero who fought
against the kidnapper.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:31.800 line:100%
Principal Qin.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:34.440 line:100%
I still need your help
to identify the culprit.

00:06:34.520 --> 00:06:35.720 line:100%
Me?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.360 line:20%
DANFENG MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.440 line:100%
Class, stand!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:14.400 line:100%
-Good morning, sir.
-Sit down.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:16.560 line:100%
Open your geometry textbooks.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.840 line:100%
<i>Let's have a recap</i>
<i>of what we learned previously.</i>

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:25.080 line:100%
Bye, sir.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.560 line:100%
Bye.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.480 line:100%
Miss, are you role-playing as Han Zi'ang?

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:35.760 line:100%
Yes.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.400 line:100%
He isn't as spirited as you are.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.320 line:100%
He spends half of his day sleeping.

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.120 line:100%
Then what does he do
for the rest of his day?

00:07:41.200 --> 00:07:43.520 line:100%
Reading comics. His mind
lives in another dimension.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.720 line:100%
Xuan. Over here.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.720 line:100%
Han Zi'ang is a weirdo, right?

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.280 line:100%
Yes. We can't understand
what he says at all.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.440 line:100%
I think he's obsessed with a cosplayer.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:54.680 line:100%
He even said he'd attend
a comic convention

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.040 line:100%
in Shanghai during summer break.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.600 line:100%
No need to search online.
His interest has changed.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.320 line:100%
He is now a fan of an anime.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.040 line:100%
Right. He loves… What is she called again?

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.200 line:100%
Nangong…

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:08.800 line:100%
This one here.

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.000 line:100%
Yes! Nangong Xuanyue.

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:15.920 line:100%
NANGONG XUANYUE

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.560 line:100%
TOGETHER FOR YOUR HEALTH
UNITED IN TRUST AND CARE

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:22.760 line:100%
Drink some water.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.040 line:100%
Everyone at school
knows you're the victim.

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:35.599 line:100%
Principal Qin said you were very brave.

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:38.599 line:100%
They are looking forward to your return.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:39.839 line:100%
Ang.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:42.719 line:100%
Do you hear me?

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.520 line:100%
Xuanyue.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:29.560 line:100%
You've come back.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.120 line:100%
He Xiaohe!

00:09:42.200 --> 00:09:43.640 line:100%
-Calm down.
-He Xiaohe!

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:44.840 line:100%
-He Xiaohe!
-You can't go in.

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:46.640 line:100%
-You can't enter.
-Let me.

00:09:46.720 --> 00:09:48.600 line:100%
You can't enter.
There's no one else inside.

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:50.200 line:100%
We've brought everyone out.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.120 line:100%
Please calm down.
We've brought everyone out.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.680 line:100%
POLICE

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:07.120 line:100%
Uncle Ran.

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:08.360 line:100%
Are you injured?

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:16.960 line:100%
Keyboard!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:18.200 line:100%
Keyboard…

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.320 line:100%
Where were you?

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:21.840 line:100%
Hey!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.760 line:100%
She was at my place.

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:25.240 line:100%
Who are you?

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.920 line:100%
Why was she at your place?
What did you do to her?

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:29.600 line:100%
-She clung to me!
-Tell me!

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.240 line:100%
-What did you do to her?
-Stop!

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:33.280 line:100%
-Let go!
-Do you know how old she is?

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.400 line:100%
Let go…

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.160 line:100%
What is wrong with you?

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.360 line:100%
-He's my friend, not a criminal!
-Come.

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:39.560 line:100%
Come back with me.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.120 line:100%
-Come!
-No! Let go of me!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.720 line:100%
I won't come back with you.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.320 line:100%
You don't even know what happened.

00:10:46.400 --> 00:10:47.880 line:100%
Don't just assume everything.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.160 line:100%
So much for thinking
you are my best friend!

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:00.040 line:100%
Xiaohe!

00:11:05.640 --> 00:11:06.520 line:100%
Double Stripe.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.040 line:100%
You peed here last time.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:10.560 line:100%
I've held a lot this time. Let's compete.

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:13.640 line:100%
-You? Maybe after you beat Bunny first.
-Come.

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.160 line:100%
Come.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.080 line:100%
Ready.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.560 line:100%
Three.

00:11:17.640 --> 00:11:19.160 line:100%
Two.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.600 line:100%
Why did you shout?

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.480 line:100%
What is that?

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:31.960 line:100%
What…

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.400 line:100%
It… It might be a person.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:38.680 line:100%
It is a person.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.480 line:100%
I've never met her.

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.120 line:100%
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.080 line:100%
-Hurry up.
-Hurry.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.160 line:100%
Open the shutter.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:30.200 line:100%
Open it.

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:34.640 line:100%
Put her in here.

00:12:36.760 --> 00:12:38.880 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:41.240 line:100%
Mister, we found a frozen girl.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:44.760 line:100%
Bring her inside.
Don't freeze her to death.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:46.680 line:100%
-Come.
-Fine.

00:12:48.480 --> 00:12:50.280 line:100%
One, two, three.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.480 line:100%
Let's go.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.800 line:100%
Careful.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.160 line:100%
Careful.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.920 line:100%
Careful.

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:03.160 line:20%
TUNZHOU CITY

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:04.320 line:100%
TUNZHOU LOCAL FAVORITES

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.720 line:100%
Mister.

00:13:10.320 --> 00:13:12.640 line:100%
-A bowl of noodles, please.
-Sure. Please go inside.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.400 line:100%
Enjoy. Careful. It's hot.

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:37.200 line:100%
Mister,

00:13:37.720 --> 00:13:39.720 line:100%
do you know

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:43.400 line:100%
any unique places in Tunzhou,

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:46.400 line:100%
or maybe a place
photographers love to visit?

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.160 line:100%
There are plenty of them.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.080 line:100%
Look.

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.680 line:100%
We have Yongji Bridge,

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.440 line:100%
Sanyi Temple, Zhang Fei's Shrine,

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.080 line:100%
and this, Tunzhou Twin Towers.

00:13:56.080 --> 00:13:58.440 line:100%
-Mister. Can I have some pepper?
-Sure.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:01.560 line:20%
YONGJI BRIDGE
SANYI TEMPLE, ZHANG FEI'S SHRINE

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.200 line:100%
Mister.

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:22.400 line:100%
Any place that is quite desolate?

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:24.120 line:100%
A place that has been abandoned for years.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:27.120 line:100%
What a peculiar preference.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:31.000 line:100%
Here.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:32.640 line:100%
This one here?

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:35.520 line:100%
COPPER FACTORY

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:39.760 line:100%
Copper Factory.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:48.840 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.440 line:100%
CONVENIENT AND AFFORDABLE

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:10.760 line:100%
Send in the soldiers.

00:15:12.240 --> 00:15:13.440 line:100%
Bunny.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:21.680 line:100%
This girl is so fierce.

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:27.480 line:100%
Wake up!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.240 line:100%
You…

00:15:30.760 --> 00:15:32.680 line:100%
Who are you? Who the heck are you?

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:34.440 line:100%
-Who are you?
-Help!

00:15:34.520 --> 00:15:35.840 line:100%
Who are you?

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:39.280 line:100%
Stop hitting him. Stop hitting him.

00:15:41.760 --> 00:15:43.360 line:100%
-Get her!
-Bring it on!

00:15:45.520 --> 00:15:47.080 line:100%
Bring it on!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.400 line:100%
Don't try to mess with me.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:51.520 line:100%
Stop!

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:55.280 line:100%
Don't come any closer!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:16.520 line:100%
<i>Hello?</i>

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.640 line:100%
Hello, Dad.

00:16:18.720 --> 00:16:20.200 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:16:20.800 --> 00:16:22.440 line:100%
Where are you calling me from?

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:26.080 line:100%
The shop by the school's gate.

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:28.200 line:100%
It's so late now.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.280 line:100%
Why aren't you at school?

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:30.680 line:100%
Why are you calling me?

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:33.360 line:100%
Nothing.

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.280 line:100%
Then I'll hang up now.

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.120 line:100%
<i>My phone is dying.</i>

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:42.480 line:100%
<i>Go back to your class.</i>

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:44.800 line:100%
Finish your homework and eat on time.

00:16:44.880 --> 00:16:46.320 line:100%
Listen to Uncle Ran.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:48.000 line:100%
<i>Do you hear me?</i>

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.280 line:100%
Hello?

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.400 line:100%
Hello?

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:57.040 line:100%
She's skipping classes again.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:06.919 line:100%
<i>Keyboard. You're gone.</i>

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.399 line:100%
<i>The band is gone.</i>

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.639 line:100%
<i>No one at home cares about me.</i>

00:17:11.399 --> 00:17:12.360 line:100%
<i>Where should I go now?</i>

00:17:17.360 --> 00:17:20.480 line:100%
<i>If you really want to learn music,</i>
<i>you can go to Beijing.</i>

00:17:23.639 --> 00:17:25.000 line:100%
Go home now.

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:28.080 line:100%
This place is not an orphanage.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:29.680 line:100%
Exactly.

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.240 line:100%
Please don't kick me out.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:40.320 line:100%
My dad…

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.600 line:100%
I was adopted.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:45.040 line:100%
My dad hits me every day
and forces me to drop out of school.

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.800 line:100%
I'm too scared to go home.

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:48.920 line:100%
I want to work

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.720 line:100%
to pay for my tuition.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:54.000 line:100%
What a rough childhood.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:55.600 line:100%
No wonder she's so violent.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:59.720 line:100%
Mister, help her out.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.120 line:100%
She has to work to fund her studies.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.760 line:100%
That's already tough enough.

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.240 line:100%
Mister, let me help you in your shop.

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:07.920 line:100%
I only have one rule.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.440 line:100%
The internet cafe
downstairs is unlicensed.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:11.960 line:100%
So don't mess it up for me.

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:42.520 line:100%
You must be Wan Qiming.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:45.800 line:20%
POLICE

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.760 line:100%
So, you found me after all.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.320 line:20%
I met her through a magazine.

00:18:57.760 --> 00:18:59.040 line:20%
We were pen pals.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:02.360 line:100%
We wrote more than
ten letters to each other.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.640 line:100%
We had feelings for each other.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.160 line:100%
So, we decided to meet up.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:10.120 line:100%
It became official then.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:12.840 line:100%
I began to look for a job in Weiyang.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.760 line:100%
She's a bit color-blind.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:25.960 line:100%
So I only took monochrome photos of her.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:28.600 line:100%
As time went by, it became a habit.

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.000 line:100%
I don't take colored photos anymore.

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.640 line:100%
Around three months after we met,

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:33.880 line:100%
she brought me home.

00:19:34.720 --> 00:19:37.280 line:100%
Her relatives were quite fond of me.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.960 line:100%
Her father was eccentric,

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.280 line:100%
but he didn't say no to it.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.720 line:100%
Everything was going so well.

00:19:58.320 --> 00:19:59.600 line:100%
Qiming.

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.240 line:100%
Let's get married.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.040 line:100%
Meng.

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:14.080 line:100%
Come with me to Guangdong.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.080 line:100%
I'd love to marry you,

00:20:17.760 --> 00:20:19.280 line:100%
but I don't have a career now.

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.640 line:100%
Weiyang is too small.

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:23.160 line:100%
I don't want to stay here
doing wedding photography forever.

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:25.720 line:100%
Let's work hard for a few years.

00:20:25.800 --> 00:20:28.080 line:100%
Once our careers are stable,
we'll get married.

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:32.680 line:100%
What's the matter?

00:20:34.720 --> 00:20:36.920 line:100%
I don't want a career.

00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:41.120 line:100%
I just want a family.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.760 line:100%
But we're still young.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.880 line:100%
We can prove ourselves.

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.600 line:100%
-Do you know that--
-Qiming.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:55.800 line:100%
I can't leave my dad.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.000 line:100%
Can you stay in Weiyang?

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:12.720 line:20%
<i>In the end, I decided</i>
<i>to head to Guangdong.</i>

00:21:13.240 --> 00:21:15.160 line:100%
We separated

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:17.280 line:100%
and resumed our written communication,
as we did before.

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:21.000 line:100%
Then she said she'd wait for me,

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:24.560 line:100%
that once I earned enough money,
I'd return to Weiyang to marry her.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.440 line:100%
I said yes.

00:21:27.880 --> 00:21:29.120 line:100%
And then?

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.800 line:100%
After more than six months,
she stopped replying to my letters.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:34.880 line:100%
I called her home,
but no one would pick up.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:37.120 line:100%
<i>During the Qingming Festival of 1996,</i>

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.520 line:100%
<i>I told my mentor</i>

00:21:38.600 --> 00:21:40.280 line:100%
<i>that I wanted to return home</i>
<i>to pay respect to my ancestors.</i>

00:21:41.040 --> 00:21:42.720 line:100%
<i>But in fact, I went</i>
<i>to Weiyang to look for her.</i>

00:22:27.600 --> 00:22:29.200 line:100%
That's when I learned

00:22:29.720 --> 00:22:32.120 line:100%
that she and her father
were in the accident at Mount Wu.

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:36.120 line:100%
To treat her dad, she took out loans.

00:22:37.680 --> 00:22:39.480 line:100%
But what I couldn't accept

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.200 line:100%
was that Xu Zhihong
forced his daughter to…

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:43.640 line:100%
For his medical bill.

00:23:05.920 --> 00:23:07.000 line:100%
Meng.

00:23:08.120 --> 00:23:09.480 line:100%
Come with me.

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:12.120 line:100%
Let's go to Guangdong.

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:18.600 line:100%
Just leave.

00:23:22.240 --> 00:23:24.280 line:100%
I don't mind what you used to do.

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:27.160 line:100%
My career is blooming right now.

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:29.400 line:100%
We'll get married
once we arrive in Guangdong.

00:23:30.320 --> 00:23:32.720 line:100%
We'll build a family. Okay?

00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:35.400 line:100%
Please?

00:23:38.400 --> 00:23:40.360 line:100%
I gave you a chance back then.

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:42.800 line:100%
Now, there's no way I can leave Weiyang.

00:23:44.000 --> 00:23:45.360 line:100%
Why do you want

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.280 line:100%
to stay in this broken home of yours?

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:55.720 line:100%
My dad is back. Go inside.

00:23:56.560 --> 00:23:57.400 line:100%
Go inside.

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:04.360 line:100%
You jerk.

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:06.680 line:100%
You dumped Meng and ran away.

00:24:06.760 --> 00:24:09.800 line:100%
I knew you were not a good man.

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:11.280 line:100%
Why are you back?

00:24:12.040 --> 00:24:14.560 line:100%
What do you want?
To lure her away with your lies again?

00:24:14.640 --> 00:24:16.800 line:100%
Dad. He came back to visit me.
He'll leave soon.

00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:18.080 line:100%
-Move aside!
-He'll leave soon.

00:24:18.160 --> 00:24:19.480 line:100%
Bugger off!

00:24:21.880 --> 00:24:24.240 line:100%
Bugger off! Bugger off! Bugger off!

00:24:24.320 --> 00:24:25.760 line:100%
Do not touch me!

00:24:25.840 --> 00:24:27.280 line:100%
You're a father.

00:24:27.360 --> 00:24:29.800 line:100%
Yet you forced your daughter
to sell her body.

00:24:29.880 --> 00:24:31.440 line:100%
What kind of man are you?

00:24:31.960 --> 00:24:33.480 line:100%
Who are you to judge me?

00:24:34.440 --> 00:24:37.040 line:100%
This is my home. I have the final say.

00:24:37.120 --> 00:24:39.880 line:100%
As long as I still live,

00:24:39.960 --> 00:24:42.440 line:100%
you will not take Meng away.

00:24:42.520 --> 00:24:43.360 line:100%
Dad, sit down.

00:24:44.840 --> 00:24:45.960 line:100%
-Bugger off!
-Dad.

00:24:46.960 --> 00:24:48.720 line:100%
Just go! Dad.

00:24:52.320 --> 00:24:53.480 line:100%
I wasn't willing to let it go initially,

00:24:53.560 --> 00:24:56.000 line:100%
so I hired the neighbor
opposite them to spy on them

00:24:57.640 --> 00:24:59.800 line:100%
and see what's going on every day.

00:25:00.320 --> 00:25:03.200 line:100%
Actually, I was hoping
that the old man would die soon.

00:25:04.800 --> 00:25:06.520 line:100%
What did your informant tell you?

00:25:08.000 --> 00:25:09.120 line:100%
Nothing in particular.

00:25:10.440 --> 00:25:12.120 line:100%
Just that she kept working

00:25:13.760 --> 00:25:15.000 line:100%
in that line of work.

00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:17.120 line:100%
If one place was busted,

00:25:17.760 --> 00:25:19.040 line:100%
she would find another.

00:25:20.120 --> 00:25:20.960 line:100%
And then?

00:25:22.280 --> 00:25:24.800 line:100%
Then, a few months ago, I saw the news

00:25:24.880 --> 00:25:26.520 line:100%
that her father had died.

00:25:35.160 --> 00:25:38.320 line:100%
Xu Zhihong was a selfish man.

00:25:39.400 --> 00:25:40.600 line:100%
Did he not deserve death?

00:25:41.800 --> 00:25:43.280 line:100%
Did he not deserve to be killed?

00:25:48.200 --> 00:25:50.440 line:100%
Do you think Xu Meng is dead?

00:25:52.080 --> 00:25:53.360 line:100%
I'm not sure about that.

00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:57.120 line:100%
But when we were pen pals, I had a hunch

00:25:57.720 --> 00:25:59.320 line:100%
that she had other pen pals.

00:26:00.400 --> 00:26:03.600 line:100%
She is the kind of girl
who likes to be doted on.

00:26:03.680 --> 00:26:05.040 line:100%
She has a temper.

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:06.960 line:100%
She is prideful.

00:26:07.840 --> 00:26:10.320 line:100%
Girls like her, in that line of work,

00:26:11.120 --> 00:26:12.360 line:100%
will offend a lot of people.

00:26:13.960 --> 00:26:16.640 line:100%
Mr. Officer, I've told you
everything I can.

00:26:18.560 --> 00:26:20.160 line:100%
I didn't kill Xu Zhihong.

00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:23.280 line:100%
And I'd never hurt Xu Meng.

00:26:25.280 --> 00:26:26.320 line:100%
Xu Meng and her father

00:26:26.960 --> 00:26:29.000 line:100%
went missing the day before
the Hong Kong handover.

00:26:29.640 --> 00:26:32.080 line:100%
My mentor took a gig back then

00:26:32.600 --> 00:26:33.920 line:100%
and brought me to Hong Kong to shoot

00:26:34.000 --> 00:26:35.880 line:100%
the lives of the Hong Kong citizens
before the reunification.

00:26:35.960 --> 00:26:38.560 line:100%
I was already away by the middle of June.

00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:43.920 line:100%
I have an alibi.

00:26:55.640 --> 00:26:56.640 line:100%
Zhao Jie.

00:26:57.200 --> 00:26:58.040 line:100%
I was looking for you.

00:26:58.120 --> 00:27:00.040 line:100%
This is the department's
annual budget. Please sign it.

00:27:00.640 --> 00:27:01.840 line:100%
I'm here to report a case.

00:27:02.520 --> 00:27:05.320 line:100%
He Xiaohe, resident of Unit 401,
Block 7, Ward 12, Poluo Street,

00:27:05.400 --> 00:27:07.120 line:100%
13 years old, might have gone missing.

00:27:07.920 --> 00:27:09.000 line:100%
I thought it was something serious.

00:27:09.080 --> 00:27:10.560 line:100%
-That's just Xiaohe being Xiaohe.
-Exactly.

00:27:10.640 --> 00:27:12.400 line:100%
She runs away every few days.

00:27:16.960 --> 00:27:18.600 line:100%
Okay. Report received.

00:27:18.680 --> 00:27:20.560 line:100%
-Chen. Register it right away.
-Okay.

00:27:23.160 --> 00:27:25.760 line:100%
Before she went missing, she was with me.

00:27:25.840 --> 00:27:28.000 line:100%
A good friend of hers
died in a fire in the bar.

00:27:28.080 --> 00:27:29.720 line:100%
She is probably traumatized.

00:27:29.800 --> 00:27:30.720 line:100%
I've heard about it.

00:27:30.800 --> 00:27:32.400 line:100%
The victim was locked in the storeroom.

00:27:32.480 --> 00:27:34.080 line:100%
Someone next door didn't
extinguish their cigarette properly,

00:27:34.160 --> 00:27:35.320 line:100%
and it fell on the carpet.

00:27:35.400 --> 00:27:36.800 line:100%
The fire burned everything.

00:27:37.320 --> 00:27:38.600 line:100%
The victim was called Keyboard.

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:40.720 line:100%
I knew him too.

00:27:46.400 --> 00:27:48.000 line:100%
Check every location on this list.

00:27:48.080 --> 00:27:49.160 line:100%
Mobilize the officers
with Mangkun as soon as possible.

00:27:49.240 --> 00:27:50.160 line:100%
Okay.

00:27:50.720 --> 00:27:51.560 line:100%
Here. Take a look.

00:27:52.320 --> 00:27:53.480 line:100%
Chen, have you registered the case?

00:27:53.560 --> 00:27:55.080 line:100%
The important information is in it.

00:27:55.160 --> 00:27:56.840 line:100%
-Have you seen this girl?
-No.

00:27:56.920 --> 00:27:58.400 line:100%
Take a look. Have you seen this girl?

00:27:58.480 --> 00:28:00.120 line:100%
-Let me see.
-Take a look.

00:28:00.200 --> 00:28:01.840 line:100%
She's this tall. Around 13 years old.

00:28:01.920 --> 00:28:03.080 line:20%
DRUMS, PERCUSSION

00:28:05.560 --> 00:28:07.080 line:100%
Sir, this is
the security footage for today.

00:28:07.160 --> 00:28:08.000 line:100%
Can you fast forward it?

00:28:08.080 --> 00:28:08.800 line:100%
-Sure.
-Fast forward it.

00:28:09.320 --> 00:28:10.520 line:100%
Let me skim through it.

00:28:10.600 --> 00:28:11.520 line:100%
SUNDAY

00:28:13.840 --> 00:28:14.920 line:100%
WEIYANG PARK, WEIYANG SQUARE
NANSHAN SUPERMARKET, WEIYANG BOOK STORE…

00:28:17.000 --> 00:28:18.240 line:100%
WEIYANG TRAIN STATION

00:28:28.440 --> 00:28:30.160 line:100%
CALLS

00:28:30.240 --> 00:28:31.240 line:100%
MENTOR

00:28:31.320 --> 00:28:34.080 line:100%
<i>The number you're dialing</i>
<i>has been switched off.</i>

00:28:34.160 --> 00:28:35.560 line:100%
<i>Please try again later.</i>

00:28:36.240 --> 00:28:37.680 line:100%
END CALL

00:28:38.320 --> 00:28:39.400 line:20%
POLICE

00:28:39.480 --> 00:28:40.840 line:100%
-Check inside.
-Okay.

00:28:40.920 --> 00:28:41.880 line:100%
WEIYANG BUS TERMINAL

00:28:46.160 --> 00:28:47.200 line:100%
Don't mind me.

00:28:47.280 --> 00:28:48.520 line:100%
WEIYANG BUS TERMINAL

00:29:06.680 --> 00:29:07.920 line:100%
RIVERSIDE MARKET

00:29:13.080 --> 00:29:14.960 line:100%
How am I supposed to go back to Ran now?

00:29:16.800 --> 00:29:18.160 line:100%
It's so cold now.

00:29:18.240 --> 00:29:19.680 line:100%
Where could she have gone?

00:29:22.520 --> 00:29:25.160 line:100%
She has always been
a hyperactive troublemaker.

00:29:25.760 --> 00:29:27.560 line:100%
I'm sure she's fine.

00:29:30.240 --> 00:29:32.440 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:29:44.400 --> 00:29:45.480 line:20%
CHINESE CHESS

00:29:52.120 --> 00:29:53.200 line:100%
See you.

00:29:53.280 --> 00:29:54.280 line:100%
Come back again.

00:30:10.760 --> 00:30:11.600 line:100%
Thank you.

00:30:11.680 --> 00:30:13.600 line:100%
Little girl, do you have cigarettes here?

00:30:13.680 --> 00:30:15.600 line:100%
No. Only snacks and drinks.

00:30:16.280 --> 00:30:18.240 line:100%
Can you get me two soft packs of Yuxi?

00:30:18.320 --> 00:30:19.720 line:100%
You can keep the change.

00:30:27.760 --> 00:30:29.080 line:100%
Yuxi is 21 yuan a pack.

00:30:29.160 --> 00:30:30.360 line:100%
This is a huge deal.

00:30:31.480 --> 00:30:33.240 line:100%
Thank you, mister.
I'll get your cigarettes now.

00:30:34.560 --> 00:30:36.680 line:100%
-Look after this for me.
-Okay.

00:30:37.640 --> 00:30:38.840 line:100%
ROUTE 36 TRAIN STATION TO MALL STREET

00:31:18.200 --> 00:31:19.040 line:100%
Keyboard.

00:31:20.360 --> 00:31:22.680 line:100%
How are you on the other side?

00:31:23.800 --> 00:31:26.760 line:100%
<i>Make sure you're practicing there too.</i>

00:31:27.720 --> 00:31:31.400 line:100%
<i>You will be the best keyboardist ever.</i>

00:31:34.640 --> 00:31:35.720 line:100%
Also,

00:31:36.640 --> 00:31:38.000 line:100%
don't be a chicken.

00:31:39.160 --> 00:31:40.360 line:100%
You'll get bullied like this.

00:31:57.720 --> 00:31:58.680 line:100%
POLICE

00:32:25.920 --> 00:32:27.560 line:20%
MOUNT WU TOURIST AREA

00:32:27.640 --> 00:32:28.960 line:100%
A three-day trip to Mount Wu.

00:32:29.480 --> 00:32:30.720 line:100%
Come take a look.

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:33.280 line:100%
It's our new offer.

00:32:33.360 --> 00:32:34.200 line:100%
Have you heard of it?

00:32:34.280 --> 00:32:36.040 line:100%
Sir. Sir.

00:32:36.120 --> 00:32:37.680 line:100%
New offer, new promotion.

00:32:37.760 --> 00:32:38.840 line:100%
Come take a look.

00:32:41.000 --> 00:32:42.400 line:100%
New offer, new promotion.

00:32:42.480 --> 00:32:44.160 line:100%
-Do you go to the train station?
-Come in.

00:32:45.560 --> 00:32:46.800 line:100%
Sir!

00:32:47.440 --> 00:32:49.280 line:100%
Sir. It has been a few tough years.

00:32:49.360 --> 00:32:50.520 line:100%
Give me a chance. Take a look.

00:32:51.760 --> 00:32:52.800 line:100%
Thank you.

00:32:52.880 --> 00:32:56.840 line:100%
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

00:32:58.080 --> 00:32:59.160 line:100%
We have a new offer.

00:32:59.240 --> 00:33:00.160 line:100%
Sorry.

00:33:00.240 --> 00:33:01.760 line:100%
New offer, new promotion.

00:33:05.160 --> 00:33:06.320 line:100%
Coming!

00:33:08.240 --> 00:33:10.320 line:100%
When is the next departure date?

00:33:10.400 --> 00:33:11.240 line:100%
Which one?

00:33:11.840 --> 00:33:13.320 line:100%
The three-day Mount Wu trip.

00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:14.400 line:100%
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY, MOUNT WU TOUR
FRIDAY DEPARTURES, 3-DAY TRIP

00:33:17.720 --> 00:33:20.240 line:100%
JIAJIA GROCERY

00:33:22.440 --> 00:33:24.320 line:100%
I bought you an egg each.
Come get your nutrition.

00:33:26.760 --> 00:33:28.400 line:100%
You've worked so hard.

00:33:28.480 --> 00:33:30.760 line:100%
Have you earned enough
for your tuition fee?

00:33:34.360 --> 00:33:35.440 line:100%
Truth be told,

00:33:36.120 --> 00:33:37.400 line:100%
I'm trying

00:33:37.480 --> 00:33:39.320 line:100%
to save for my train ticket to Beijing.

00:33:39.920 --> 00:33:41.040 line:100%
To Beijing?

00:33:41.120 --> 00:33:43.240 line:100%
Are you going there
to study at Tsinghua University?

00:33:43.320 --> 00:33:44.440 line:100%
Little girl.

00:33:44.520 --> 00:33:45.360 line:100%
The usual, please.

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:47.440 line:100%
You can keep the change.

00:33:48.920 --> 00:33:49.760 line:100%
Thank you, mister.

00:33:50.920 --> 00:33:51.920 line:100%
Wait.

00:33:52.760 --> 00:33:53.600 line:100%
The beer is on me.

00:33:56.680 --> 00:33:58.440 line:100%
I'm a Buddhist. I don't drink.

00:33:58.520 --> 00:33:59.560 line:100%
Thank you, though.

00:34:01.280 --> 00:34:05.160 line:100%
SPICY CHICKEN BITES
WITH SECRET FAMILY RECIPE

00:34:21.840 --> 00:34:22.840 line:100%
Sorry.

00:34:24.920 --> 00:34:26.479 line:100%
He Xiaohe. Is that a cigarette pack I see?

00:34:29.039 --> 00:34:29.959 line:100%
Stay right there!

00:34:33.479 --> 00:34:34.600 line:100%
Stay right there!

00:34:38.959 --> 00:34:40.240 line:100%
He Xiaohe. Stay right there.

00:34:40.320 --> 00:34:40.920 line:100%
YUXI CIGARETTE

00:34:40.999 --> 00:34:42.640 line:100%
She can run.

00:34:43.320 --> 00:34:44.320 line:100%
Stay right there.

00:34:44.840 --> 00:34:46.120 line:100%
Stop. Stay right there.

00:34:49.400 --> 00:34:50.240 line:100%
Stop.

00:34:55.560 --> 00:34:57.240 line:100%
He Xiaohe. Stop.

00:34:57.320 --> 00:34:59.120 line:100%
You really can run.

00:35:20.440 --> 00:35:21.400 line:100%
Let's see where you can go now.

00:35:23.080 --> 00:35:24.040 line:100%
I'll stay.

00:35:42.120 --> 00:35:43.760 line:100%
-Bye, sir.
-You…

00:35:52.840 --> 00:35:54.200 line:100%
1.4 meters. This tall.

00:35:54.280 --> 00:35:55.240 line:100%
Take a look.

00:35:59.280 --> 00:36:00.920 line:100%
Mister.

00:36:01.000 --> 00:36:02.080 line:100%
Zhao Jie.

00:36:02.600 --> 00:36:03.960 line:100%
Captain Ran. Qu.

00:36:12.360 --> 00:36:14.560 line:100%
It was very cold that night.
She couldn't have run far.

00:36:14.640 --> 00:36:17.000 line:100%
Focus on the 24-hour shops

00:36:17.080 --> 00:36:18.640 line:100%
within the red circles.

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:20.680 line:100%
Let's split up and search.

00:36:20.760 --> 00:36:21.720 line:100%
It'll be more efficient.

00:36:21.800 --> 00:36:23.280 line:100%
Mangkun, Chen. You guys go here.

00:36:23.360 --> 00:36:24.480 line:20%
I'll take this one. Okay?

00:36:24.560 --> 00:36:26.080 line:100%
-Okay.
-Split the workload among yourselves.

00:36:26.600 --> 00:36:27.920 line:100%
Hi, Mr. Zhang.

00:36:28.000 --> 00:36:28.960 line:100%
Hello?

00:36:29.040 --> 00:36:30.680 line:100%
Are you the parent of He Xiaohe?

00:36:30.760 --> 00:36:32.720 line:100%
She didn't come to class today.

00:36:32.800 --> 00:36:35.320 line:100%
I saw her running around with cigarettes.
Will you please discipline her?

00:36:36.480 --> 00:36:38.200 line:100%
When? Where did you see her?

00:36:38.280 --> 00:36:39.680 line:100%
Tell me more.

00:36:43.160 --> 00:36:44.200 line:100%
I see.

00:36:44.280 --> 00:36:45.480 line:100%
Forgive me, Mr. Zhang.

00:36:45.560 --> 00:36:46.760 line:100%
I'll lecture her later.

00:36:49.000 --> 00:36:49.880 line:100%
Xiaohe has appeared.

00:36:49.960 --> 00:36:51.920 line:100%
Someone saw her
buying cigarettes at Nanhu Market.

00:36:52.000 --> 00:36:53.600 line:100%
They even found
bus tickets in her pockets.

00:36:53.680 --> 00:36:55.320 line:100%
Nanhu Market.

00:36:55.400 --> 00:36:56.440 line:100%
Bus tickets.

00:36:56.520 --> 00:36:57.680 line:100%
And cigarettes too?

00:37:02.080 --> 00:37:04.280 line:100%
Check all bus stations
that serve Nanhu Market.

00:37:04.360 --> 00:37:05.240 line:100%
Okay.

00:37:05.320 --> 00:37:06.760 line:100%
NANHU MARKET